{'symbol': 'WRB', 'date': '2021-07-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'W. R. BERKLEY CORPORATION NAMES GLEN RIDDELL CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF BERKLEY RE AUSTRALIA', 'text': 'GREENWICH, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--W. R. BERKLEY CORPORATION (NYSE: WRB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF GLEN RIDDELL, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF BERKLEY RE ASIA, TO THE ADDITIONAL ROLE OF CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF BERKLEY RE AUSTRALIA. THE APPOINTMENT IS EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 31, 2021. TONY PIPER WILL CONTINUE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF BERKLEY RE AUSTRALIA UNTIL THAT TIME, WHEN HE WILL TRANSITION INTO THE ROLE OF CHAIRMAN OF THE OPERATING UNIT. MR. RIDDELL JOINED BERKLEY RE ASIA IN 2015 A'}